This repository contains simulator adapter snapshots from the VibeStick
firmware projects listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The snapshots are included
so a clean checkout builds without sibling repositories. Imported project
source is read-only and is compiled only after the user chooses Reload
Firmware.

VibeStick-Codex and VibeStick-Agent-Hub contain work based on VibeStick by
Gary Zhang. Their original attribution and licenses are preserved in
Vendor/Licenses/.

